 "notes": [
  "Snap to beats_s and downbeats_s: a smooth fit to the tracked beats under the drums (9 ms RMS from them), run on through the intro. bpm and beat_s are averages and the tempo drifts within bpm_range, so don't rebuild the grid from them.",
  "Bar 0 is the first drop, at 14.38 s. downbeats_s[0] is bar -8, so bar b starts at downbeats_s[b + 8].",
  "tracked_beats_s is librosa's raw beat tracker output, for reference only. It wanders by up to half a beat where there are no drums.",
  "Sections follow the audio and start on bar lines. Their labels place the lyric lines from words.json (forced alignment, 28 Sep); a line can start before its section, as a pickup.",
  "The permission-dialog climax: the whispered 'Allow?' at bar 107.9 (3:27.5), then the final drop on bar 109 (3:29.6), with 'Access granted.' two bars later (3:33.2)."
 ]
